# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Word beginnings — Principios (CBE B 16-1 V3 §3.1, Tabla 11 & §3.1.1)
# Principios cannot be used directly before a vowel; in concatenated chains only
# the final principio must precede a consonant.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

before vowels begword com 14-2456
before vowels begword con 14-1346
before vowels begword dis 145-24-234
before vowels begword entre 26-356-15
before vowels begword ex 15-1346
