# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secuencias (CBE B 16-1 V3 §3.3, Tabla 15)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
always para 456-16
begmidword ante 456-146
begmidword que 12345
# 'esta' (1356): before C initially, between C midword, after C finally
before consonants begword esta 1356
after consonants before consonants midword esta 1356
after consonants endword esta 1356

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contiguous contractions priority (CBE B 16-1 V3 §3.4.1, Tabla 19)
# When three letters can contract two ways, the second pair wins.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
always abr 1-23a
always adr 1-256a
always all 1-123456
always uem 136-126
always uen 136-26a
always uer 136-236a
always ues 136-1246

